WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.672 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect.

00:00:01.722 --> 00:00:06.813 line:78%
One of the greatest misconceptions about transformation is that it's only about us.

00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:08.063 line:78%
It isn't.

00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:14.062 line:78%
When one person begins living with intention, the impact naturally extends beyond
their own life.

00:00:14.112 --> 00:00:17.792 line:78%
Family. Friends. Communities. Even people they've never met.

00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:22.749 line:78%
That's the power of a life lived intentionally. This chapter is about expansion.

00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:27.644 line:78%
Not building a bigger life. But building a life that makes a bigger difference.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:35.852 line:78%
As you reflect on the pages ahead, consider this question: Who will benefit because
you chose to intentionally create your Back Half?

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:40.318 line:78%
Your answer may become one of the most meaningful parts of your Journey.

00:00:40.368 --> 00:00:42.030 line:78%
When you're ready... Let's begin Chapter Six.
